+------+-------+-------+------+
| id   | m     | m2    | u2   |
+------+-------+-------+------+
|    4 | 81,82 | 91,92 |   12 |
+------+-------+-------+------+
––– input –––
mysql -h0 -P9306 -N -B -e "SELECT id FROM t WHERE knn(vec, 1, 'four') LIMIT 1" | grep -v '^+' | tr -d '| '
